---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Fasteners — Bolts, Nuts & Threaded Bars" active="/products">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Inconel & Stainless Fasteners" title="Fasteners" description="A qualitative range of Inconel fasteners from best-grade raw material — sturdy, corrosion-resistant, durable, built to international standards and to client drawings." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container layout-2col">
      <div class="prose">
<h3>Fasteners</h3>
<p>Serving the demands of various industries, we offer a qualitative range of Inconel fasteners fabricated from best-grade raw material. Available in different sizes and grades, these fasteners are sturdy in construction, resistant to corrosion and highly durable. Quality being the priority, we design to international industrial standards — and to clients' specific requirements.</p>
        <div class="details">
        <div>
          <b>Bolts</b>
          <span>Stud bolts, hex head bolts, socket hexagon head screws, anchor bolts, U-bolts, J-bolts, mushroom head square neck bolts, T-head bolts, wing screws, eye bolts, foundation bolts, structural bolts</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Washers</b>
          <span>Plain washers, big & small OD washers, spring lock washers, heavy-duty spring washers, tooth washers, star washers, tab washers with one & two tabs</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Nuts</b>
          <span>Hexagon nuts, coupling nuts, thin nuts, square nuts, castle nuts, self-locking nuts, domed cap nuts</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Screws</b>
          <span>Pan/cheese/countersunk slotted screws, Philips head screws, trim head machine screws, Allen cap screws, Allen countersunk screws, shoulder screws, low-head cap screws, socket set screws (flat, cone, dog and cup point), imperial socket cap screws</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Other</b>
          <span>Threaded rod — M6 to M64, 1 to 4 mtr lengths — plus fully as-per-drawing manufacture</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Coatings</b>
          <span>Hot-dipped galvanizing · phosphate · PTFE · Xylan · zinc · cadmium</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Standards</b>
          <span>As per EN 10204 / 3.1B with MTC</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Grades</b>
          <span>UNS 8825 (Inconel 825) · UNS 6600 (600) · UNS 6601 (601) · UNS 6625 (625) · Austenitic stainless steels: ASTM 304/304L and ASTM 316/316L · Duplex stainless steel: SAF 2205 / UNS S31803 / EN 1.4462 · Super-duplex stainless steel: SAF 2507 / UNS S32750 / EN 1.4410</span>
        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
